  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "During the Liu tribe and Hei tribe battle, Bei tribe elder Bei Cao Sheng sacrifices himself and entrusts his soul to Bei Cao Chuan so they can contest Wolf King Chang Shan Yin. Using Liu Wen Wu’s Gu worm, Bei Cao Chuan absorbs the power of Bei Cao Sheng’s soul and gains enslavement path master attainment for a short period.",
